# ====================================================
# ⚠️ ARCHITECTURE NOTE ON /dist/
# ====================================================
# Normally, build outputs like /dist/ or /build/ go here.
# However, because we are using raw.githubusercontent.com 
# to serve these files, and our GitHub Action bot needs 
# to commit them, we explicitly leave /dist/ UN-IGNORED.
